---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title={SITE_TITLE}
	baseTitle=`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
>
	<p>
		Hi! I’m Mauro, a Full Stack Developer based in Madrid with over 14 years of professional experience, and a strong frontend focus. I’m passionate about building scalable, high-performance web and mobile applications that make a real impact. Throughout my career, I’ve led cross-functional teams across Spain and India, architected cloud-based solutions, and driven digital transformations in sectors like finance and e-commerce. Whether migrating legacy systems or crafting intuitive user interfaces, I bring a hands-on, quality-first approach from architecture to deployment. My toolkit includes Angular, Spring Boot, Node.js, and GCP—and I’m always eager to adopt emerging technologies. Problem-solving is my playground, and teamwork is my secret weapon.
	</p>
</Layout>
